---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import Catalog from '@/components/Catalog.astro';
import {hrefFor} from '@/lib/vault';
import {formGalleryInfo} from '@/lib/form-gallery';
---
<BaseLayout title="Form finder" active="forms" wide><div class="page-shell"><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">CREATURES, MINIONS &amp; FORMS</p><h1>Choose the right form.</h1><p>Find transformation, familiar, and binding references. A checked candidate flag covers the stat block; the spell’s other requirements still apply.</p><div class="toolbar"><a class="button" href={hrefFor('Form Legality Guide')}>Check form legality</a><a class="button" href={hrefFor('000 Minion Management')}>Manage your minions</a><a href={hrefFor('Polymorph Friendly&Hostile Tier List')}>Form priorities →</a></div></header><aside class="context-notice"><h2>Checked cards and original galleries</h2><p>All {formGalleryInfo.entryCount} creatures shown in the vault’s galleries are listed here: {formGalleryInfo.checkedCardCount} metadata-checked cards and {formGalleryInfo.galleryOnlyCount} additional stat-block references. Review status keeps them distinct. Image-only or image-transcribed entries do not gain eligibility flags from their gallery placement.</p><p>Stat filters match recorded values only; unknown values are excluded. Candidate-route filters show reviewed flags only. Use <em>More filters</em> to choose a review status or source gallery, and compare original images alongside the recorded details.</p></aside><Catalog kind="forms"/></div></BaseLayout>
